hadiths[19]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Ilm utha liya jaega, fitne zahir honge aur qatl bahut ho jaega.' Ham ne un se poocha: Harj kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Qatl.' Jab Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka yeh farman suna: 'Ilm utha liya jaega,' to unhon ne kaha: 'Ilm ka chale jana yeh nahin ke use logon ke seenon se nikal liya jaega, balke ilm ka khatm hona ulama ke khatm hone se hai.'"
"2","[AI-translation] Ja'far ne isi sanad se isi ki misl riwayat ki hai, aur unhon ne kaha: «فناء العلماء» (ulama ka fana ho jana)."
"3","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Logon par ek zamana aaega jab log tumhen aisi hadeesen sunaenge jo na tum ne suni hongi na tumhare baapon ne, to tum un se bacho.'"
"4","[AI-translation] Ka'b se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Ek qaum aaegi jo apni baton ko jhoot se muzayyan karegi; unhen ashab al-alwah kaha jaega. Moti ko jauhar se alag kiya jaega.'"
"5","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jis ne meri taraf se woh baat kahi jo main ne nahin kahi to woh apna thikana jahannam mein bana le. Aur jis se us ke Musalman bhai ne mashwara manga aur us ne use durust mashwara na diya to us ne us se khiyanat ki. Aur jis ne baghair tehqeeq ke fatwa diya to us ka gunah us fatwa dene wale par hai.'"
"6","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Jis ne baghair ilm ke fatwa diya to us ka gunah us fatwa dene wale par hai.'"
"7","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Mujhe aise logon ke sath baithna jo namaz fajr se tulu' aaftab tak Allah se dua karte aur Us ka zikr karte hain, Aulad Ismail mein se chaar ghulamon ko aazad karne se ziyada mahboob hai, ya asr se ghurub aaftab tak ke main un ke misl aazad karun.'"
"8","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Abdul Malik ne kaha: Jab Ibn Mubarak (Rahimahullah) ne yeh hadees zikr ki aur un mein se baaz ne is ka inkar kiya to unhon ne kaha: Yeh bure log hamen rokna chahte hain ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki hadees ko chhor den aur use bayan na karen. Jab bhi ham kisi hadees ka ma'na na samjhen use chhor den? Nahin, balke ham use isi tarah riwayat karenge jaise ham ne suna hai aur jahalat ko apne nafs par lazam karenge."
"9","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Aey Allah! Main chaar cheezon se Teri panah mangta hun: aise ilm se jo nafa na de, aise dil se jo dare nahin, aise nafs se jo sair na ho aur aisi dua se jo suni na jae.'"
"10","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jis ke sath Allah bhalai ka irada farmata hai use deen mein samajh ata farmata hai.'"
"11","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Log khair o shar mein ma'dinon ki tarah hain. To un mein se jo jahiliyyat mein behtar the wohi Islam mein bhi behtar hain jab woh deen mein samajh hasil karen.'"
"12","[AI-translation] Shahr bin Haushab ne kaha: Surah Al-An'am nazil hui, aur us ke sath farishton ki garaj ki awaz thi; unhon ne aasman duniya se zameen tak bhar rakha tha. Unhon ne kaha: Woh Makki surat hai, siwae us ki do ayaton: ayat «قُلْ تَعَالَوْا أَتْلُ مَا حَرَّمَ رَبُّكُمْ عَلَيْكُمْ» aur ayat «وَلَا تَقْرَبُوا مَالَ الْيَتِيمِ إِلَّا بِالَّتِي هِيَ أَحْسَنُ» ke."
"13","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne (Surah Hud ki ayat 46) «عَمَلٌ غَيْرُ صَالِحٍ» ko is tarah padha «عَمَلَ غَيْرُ صَالِحٍ»: 'Us ne naik amal nahin kiye.'"
"14","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko (Surah Az-Zumar ki ayat) «قُلْ يَا عِبَادِيَ الَّذِينَ أَسْرَفُوا عَلَى أَنْفُسِهِمْ لَا تَقْنَطُوا مِنْ رَحْمَةِ اللَّهِ إِنَّ اللَّهَ يَغْفِرُ الذُّنُوبَ جَمِيعًا (وَلَا يُبَالِي) إِنَّهُ هُوَ الْغَفُورُ الرَّحِيمُ» [39-Az-Zumar:53] padhte suna (yani main ne unhen lafz «وَلَا يُبَالِي» padhte suna)."
"15","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko «إِنَّهُ عَمِلَ غَيْرُ صَالِحٍ» padhte suna."
"16","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne is (Surah Hud ayat 46) ke bare mein poocha, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne padha: «إِنَّهُ عَمِلَ غَيْرُ صَالِحٍ»."
"17","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ham sirf Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees yaad kiya karte the; lekin jab tum ne har sakht aur naram zameen par chalna shuru kar diya to (aitemad) bahut door ki baat hai."
"18","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se marfoo'an riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Do harees hain jin dono mein se kisi ki hirs khatm nahin hoti: ilm ke talab mein harees, us ki hirs khatm nahin hoti; aur duniya ke talab mein harees, us ki hirs bhi khatm nahin hoti.'"
"19","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jo bhi sunnat jari ki use main janta hun, aur main nahin janta ke Aap zuhr aur asr mein qira'at karte the ya nahin. Aur main nahin janta ke Aap padhte the: «وَقَدْ بَلَغْتُ مِنَ الْكِبَرِ عِتِيًّا أَوْ عُسِيًّا» [19-Maryam:8] — aur main teesri cheez bhool gaya hun.'"
